onse to Marty Mcfly):"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Doesn't affect Spiders / Cave spiders, as these mobs are not slowed by cobwebs."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Doesn't affect flying mobs (Bees, Bats, Ghasts, Phantoms) or mobs summoned with"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/summon minecraft:creeper ~ ~ ~ {NoGravity:1b}"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now tested for short duration pulses (in response to Gnamf Jojo):"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Works for all pulses, down to 0-tick pulses (make sure there's no block under the cobweb)"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Updates:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"When a player is pushed within the cobweb, they are put into swim mode."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This glitch also affects Minecarts that are still on rails."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Code analysis"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Code analysis by "},{"type":"mention","attrs":{"id":"unknown","text":"@unknown","accessLevel":""}},{"type":"text","text":" can be found in "},{"type":"text","text":"this comment","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC-211096?focusedId=1247126&page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-1247126"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":" "}]}]},"customfield_10054":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10023","value":"Confirmed","id":"10023"},"fixVersions":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/version/17384","id":"17384","name":"1.2